{
  "name": "kaizen",
  "version": "1.39.0",
  "description": "Schema-driven workflow plugin for Claude Code. Ships discipline + orchestration in one skill: 14 routines (8 hardcoded + 6 declarative), 12 pre-commit gates, sizing model by trace+sem+grep, pre-deletion belief, ZWSP-safe ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT} substitution, deletion audit log. Bundles 49 skills across families: 9 coding-skills (DRY/KISS/YAGNI/SOLID/LoD/SoC/Boy-Scout/Convention + Karpathy), onion-ddd-workflow, 14 superpowers, workflow + workflow-routing merge, 5 remember/Second-Brain (capture/process/evolve/reflect/synthesize/remember/status), self-improving auto-memory curator, code-tour persona walkthroughs, command-development, plugin-pitfalls, behaviour-config, publishing. 6 sub-agents (kaizen-reviewer / kaizen-backlog-curator / kaizen-debt-auditor / kaizen-karpathy-reviewer / kaizen-memory-analyst / kaizen-skill-extractor) with worktree isolation. 21 MCP servers composed behind a single FastMCP gateway (kaizen). Self-contained: no external plugin dependencies.",
  "author": {
    "name": "YugeIceCone",
    "url": "https://github.com/YugeIceCone"
  },
